<p>
Was creation in despair<br>
on that single day in history<br>
when Nietzsche&rsquo;s word<br>
rang true?
</p>

<p>
The tomb is sealed,<br>
the body is cold,<br>
and heaven mourns<br>
at what we have done.
</p>

<p>
God is dead,<br>
and we have killed him.
</p>

<p>
Lord, have mercy.
</p>

<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>



